  "title": "Carrot Cream Cheese Muffins",
  "description": "These are terrific carrot muffins with a dash of orange juice mixed into the batter. They 're even topped with a lush mixture of cream cheese and walnuts.",
  "authors": [
    "Kerstin"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-02-11T08:24:43-05:00",
